            ^"Section" STRING "Arcane Abilities"
            ^"Printed Entry" STRING "The Monks of Llancarfan, The Llancarfan Saints’ Lives, Dominion Lore Tractatus, Quality 6. As a twelfth-century book, this is evidence that trade was still occurring in the last fifty or so years. (6BP)"
            ^"Source" STRING "Through the Aegis"
            ^"Page" INTEGER 123
        }
    }

