            ^"Kind" STRING "Tractatus"
            ^"Quality" INTEGER 8
            ^"Build Points" INTEGER 8
            ^"Section" STRING "Arcane Abilities"
            ^"Printed Entry" STRING "Cearnach of Verditius, In innectis de phylacterium, Magic Theory Tractatus, Quality 8. Casts Magic Theory in the role of mechanism, made up of the constituent Arts. Describes the Mysteries as mere application of that mechanism. (8BP)"
