            ^"Build Points" INTEGER 9
            ^"Section" STRING "Arcane Abilities"
            ^"Printed Entry" STRING "Tadhg an Tuir of Verditius, Codex of Enchantments, Magic Theory Tractatus, Quality 9. Demonstrates principles of Magic Theory by examples of simple device enchantments known across the Order. The work makes reference to calculations and formulae apparently provided in another text, now sadly missing. This makes the book harder to work with and costs a three day distraction. (9BP)"
            ^"Source" STRING "Through the Aegis"
            ^"Page" INTEGER 123
        }
    }

